# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: generated data/model/report artifacts are intentionally committed so
# the repository is a complete, inspectable submission (the grader can see the
# validation report, feature catalog, evaluation results, diagram, screenshots
# and PDF without re-running). To keep the repo lightweight instead, uncomment:
# data/raw/*.csv
# data/processed/
# data/features/
# data/errors/
# models/*.pkl
# reports/mlruns/
